      "id": "claim_cef635918fde49daae5cf0282a34e52b",
      "statement": "On shutdown the container attempts a bounded S3 sync of /home/sre that excludes OCM and kubeconfig paths and disables symlink following; task deadline enforcement is handled separately by a scheduled reaper Lambda, which before stopping an expired task calls has_active_ssm_session to check the task's enableExecuteCommand flag and query SSM DescribeSessions for an active ECS Exec session, failing closed (recording a protected or error outcome instead of stopping the task) when that session state cannot be reliably determined.",
